* MOSFET Transistor Definitions
* PMOS: drain gate source

M1 22 222 5 5 PMOS

* NMOS: drain gate source

M2 2 4 2 2 NMOS

* Current Source
IS 2 222 <VALUE> ; Current source from node 222 to 2.

* Voltage Sources
VDD 5 0 DC <VALUE> ; VDD connected to node 5
VSS 2 0 DC <VALUE> ; VSS connected to node 2

* Simulation Commands
.op
.end